{"issues":[{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"16608","self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/16608","key":"MC-236341","renderedFields":{"summary":null,"issuetype":null,"watches":null,"customfield_10070":null,"customfield_10061":"","created":"11/Sep/21 10:43 AM","customfield_10050":"","customfield_10051":null,"description":"<h3><a name=\"Thebug\"></a>The bug</h3>\n<p>You can feed hay bales to adult donkeys, horses or mules, but hand animation and animal eating animation/sounds are not played.</p>\n\n<p>The distinction of this issue from \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"MC-93825\">\n                <a href=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/browse/MC-93825\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\" title=\"Client can always use food to reduce temper of horses, llamas and donkeys, ignoring animal's temper value\">\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10303?size=medium\">\n            MC-93825\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Resolved</span>\n            </span>\n is that it is NOT a desync, and it is not \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"MC-233276\">\n                <a href=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/browse/MC-233276\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\" title=\"You can feed adult donkeys, horses, llamas or mules with maximum Temper value, and hand animation is not played\">\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10303?size=medium\">\n            MC-233276\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Resolved</span>\n            </span>\n as it happens regardless of the animal's temper value, and <em>no other food</em> exhibits this behavior, only hay bales. Also unlike \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"MC-233276\">\n                <a href=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/browse/MC-233276\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\" title=\"You can feed adult donkeys, horses, llamas or mules with maximum Temper value, and hand animation is not played\">\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10303?size=medium\">\n            MC-233276\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Resolved</span>\n            </span>\n, this does <em>not</em> affect llamas.</p>\n\n<h3><a name=\"Toreproduce\"></a>To reproduce</h3>\n<p>1. Summon a donkey, horse or mule.<br>\n2. Feed the animal hay bales.<br>\n3. <img class=\"emoticon\" src=\"/images/icons/emoticons/error.png\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\" border=\"0\"> The hay bales will be consumed, but no animations or sounds are played.</p>\n\n<h3><a name=\"Expectedresult\"></a>Expected result</h3>\n<p>Animations and sounds should be played when you feed hay bales to adult donkeys, horses and mules, or adult donkeys, horses and mules should not consume hay bales to begin with, in line with how they used to behave in the past (see <a href=\"https://bugs.mojang.com/browse/MC-236341?focusedId=1237183&amp;page=com.atlassian.jira.plugin.system.issuetabpanels:comment-tabpanel#comment-1237183\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">this comment</a>).</p>\n\n<h3><a name=\"Codeanalysis%28tentative%29\"></a>Code analysis (tentative)</h3>\n<p><b>If adult donkeys, horses and mules should consume the hay bales:</b><br>\nThere appears to be a missing line in <tt>AbstractHorse.java</tt>:</p>\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeHeader panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;\"><b>net.minecraft.world.entity.animal.horse.AbstractHorse.java (Mojang mappings, 1.18-pre1)</b></div><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">...\n<span class=\"code-keyword\">protected</span> <span class=\"code-object\">boolean</span> handleEating(Player $$0, ItemStack $$1) {\n        <span class=\"code-object\">boolean</span> $$2 = <span class=\"code-keyword\">false</span>;\n        <span class=\"code-object\">float</span> $$3 = 0.0f;\n        <span class=\"code-object\">int</span> $$4 = 0;\n        <span class=\"code-object\">int</span> $$5 = 0;\n        <span class=\"code-keyword\">if</span> ($$1.is(Items.WHEAT)) {\n            $$3 = 2.0f;\n            $$4 = 20;\n            $$5 = 3;\n        } \n        ...\n        <span class=\"code-keyword\">else</span> <span class=\"code-keyword\">if</span> ($$1.is(Blocks.HAY_BLOCK.asItem())) {\n            $$3 = 20.0f;\n            $$4 = 180;\n            <span class=\"code-comment\">/** There should be a $$5 here? */</span> \n        } \n        ...\n        <span class=\"code-keyword\">else</span> <span class=\"code-keyword\">if</span> ($$1.is(Items.GOLDEN_CARROT)) {\n            $$3 = 4.0f;\n            $$4 = 60;\n            $$5 = 5;\n            ...\n        } \n        ...\n        <span class=\"code-keyword\">if</span> ($$5 &gt; 0 &amp;&amp; ($$2 || !<span class=\"code-keyword\">this</span>.isTamed()) &amp;&amp; <span class=\"code-keyword\">this</span>.getTemper() &lt; <span class=\"code-keyword\">this</span>.getMaxTemper()) {\n            $$2 = <span class=\"code-keyword\">true</span>;\n            <span class=\"code-keyword\">if</span> (!<span class=\"code-keyword\">this</span>.level.isClientSide) {\n                <span class=\"code-keyword\">this</span>.modifyTemper($$5);\n            }\n        }\n       <span class=\"code-keyword\">if</span> ($$2) {\n            <span class=\"code-keyword\">this</span>.eating();\n            <span class=\"code-keyword\">this</span>.gameEvent(GameEvent.EAT, <span class=\"code-keyword\">this</span>.eyeBlockPosition());\n        }\n</pre>\n</div></div>\n<p>The variable <tt>$$5</tt> appears to control the <tt>Temper</tt> and the eating event, and it is missing for the hay bale. Llamas override this method in their own class, which would explain why they are not affected.</p>\n\n<p><b>If they should not consume the hay bales</b>:<br>\nCode analysis by <a href=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=BugCrusherszz\" rel=\"noreferrer\">BugCrusherszz</a> can be found in <a href=\"https://bugs.mojang.com/browse/MC-236341?focusedId=1236962&amp;page=com.atlassian.jira.plugin.system.issuetabpanels:comment-tabpanel#comment-1236962\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">this comment</a>.</p>","customfield_10054":null,"fixVersions":null,"customfield_10055":null,"resolution":null,"customfield_10047":"17/Sep/21 4:06 PM","customfield_10048":null,"labels":null,"customfield_10049":null,"attachment":[{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/28467","id":"28467","filename":"2021-07-28 10-21-35.mp4","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/2bf89af0fdd92ce25290c17873c786fe?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FA-4.png","24x24":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/2bf89af0fdd92ce25290c17873c786fe?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FA-4.png","16x16":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/2bf89af0fdd92ce25290c17873c786fe?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FA-4.png","32x32":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/2bf89af0fdd92ce25290c17873c786fe?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FA-4.png"},"displayName"